OL,3,ABoots sold in #7bn deal to Canadian
OL,4,Abillionaire family
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoots, the High Street pharmacy and
OL,7,Fretail chain, has been sold in an
OL,8,F$8.9bn (#6.7bn) deal to the holding
OL,9,Fcompany of Canada's billionaire Weston
OL,10,Ffamily.
OL,12,FWittington Investments confirmed it had
OL,13,Fagreed to buy Boots on Wednesday from
OL,14,FUS private equity firm Sycamore
OL,15,FPartners.
OL,17,FSycamore had only owned the retailer
OL,18,Ffor 18 months after taking over the
OL,19,Fretailer's previous owner.
