OL,3,ABoots sold in #7bn deal to Canadian
OL,4,Abillionaire family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deal covers Boots' retail
OL,7,Foperations in the UK and Ireland, Boots
OL,8,FOpticians, No7 Beauty Company and its
OL,9,FThailand and franchised businesses.
